From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frank Li <frankli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 03:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm: sunxi-hdmi: release DDC I2C master from reset

The HDMI DDC controller never reports DONE or ERROR when the I2C master
is held in reset, so EDID reads time out with "dw i2cm wait state
timeout". Release the DDC I2C master before programming the bus speed.

---
 bsp/drivers/drm/sunxi_device/hardware/lowlevel_hdmi20/dw_i2cm.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/bsp/drivers/drm/sunxi_device/hardware/lowlevel_hdmi20/dw_i2cm.c b/bsp/drivers/drm/sunxi_device/hardware/lowlevel_hdmi20/dw_i2cm.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/bsp/drivers/drm/sunxi_device/hardware/lowlevel_hdmi20/dw_i2cm.c
+++ b/bsp/drivers/drm/sunxi_device/hardware/lowlevel_hdmi20/dw_i2cm.c
@@ -238,7 +238,7 @@ int dw_i2cm_re_init(void)
 {
 	struct dw_i2cm_s *i2cm = dw_get_i2cm();
 
-	dw_write_mask(I2CM_SOFTRSTZ, I2CM_SOFTRSTZ_I2C_SOFTRSTZ_MASK, 0x0);
+	dw_write_mask(I2CM_SOFTRSTZ, I2CM_SOFTRSTZ_I2C_SOFTRSTZ_MASK, 0x1);
 
 	dw_write_mask(I2CM_DIV, I2CM_DIV_FAST_STD_MODE_MASK, i2cm->mode);
 
-- 
